1
00:00:24,544 --> 00:00:28,016
It’s 8:00 in the evening in Chongqing, China.

2
00:00:28,592 --> 00:00:31,440
Some people are rushing to get home from work.

3
00:00:31,696 --> 00:00:33,376
But others are not in a hurry!

4
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:36,272
They are enjoying the city at night.

5
00:00:36,912 --> 00:00:39,568
Lights are shining brightly across the city,

6
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:43,232
and colourful boats are moving slowly down the river.

7
00:00:43,568 --> 00:00:45,936
People are eating delicious food,

8
00:00:46,304 --> 00:00:49,152
such as Chongqing hot pot and noodles.

